# Release artifacts (wheel AND sdist) ship only the package code and the runtime assets
# listed under [tool.setuptools.package-data] in pyproject.toml: the trained ONNX models
# brainmaze_eeg_models/*/_models/*.onnx, which must stay (never exclude *.onnx here).
# This file only keeps setuptools' default sdist extras out. The real guard is the shared
# artifact check (brainmaze-sphinx check-dist.yml, `dist-check: error` + `required-assets`
# in ci.yml and release.yml), which fails on anything else and on a missing model.
prune tests
prune docs_src
prune img
prune demo
prune tools
prune .github
